{"type":"reasoning","timestamp":1778500746330,"sessionID":"ses_1e918dcfeffe7MKmheuR9WD4Yw","part":{"id":"prt_e16e75878001YaNspi3hQiDGI0","messageID":"msg_e16e751b2001U8EGROQyNMEHLs","sessionID":"ses_1e918dcfeffe7MKmheuR9WD4Yw","type":"reasoning","text":"We need to implement task 1: create the scaffold index.html and meta.json with appropriate content, based on CONVENTIONS.md and some design notes. The design is described as “Quantum Leap”, concept: Tap to instantly warp the dot forward a set distance, leaping over upcoming obstacles. The warp has a short cooldown, requiring careful timing.\n\nBut task 1 is just to create scaffolding: index.html with header, canvas, restart button, and empty script; meta.json file following CONVENTIONS.md schema. Must match meta.json fields: title, description, controls, tags. The header content must match meta.json values accordingly. Use the title \"Quantum Leap\". Provide description likely summarizing concept.\n\nControls: based on input design: “Tap to warp” – but we need keyboard or mouse? $ meta must include an array of strings with short descriptions. Could include \"Tap to warp forward\", \"Press R or click Restart\". But the \"Tap\" suggests mouse click/tap on canvas. However the required controls for validator: I'd include \"Tap/click to warp\", \"Press R or click Restart\". Make sure ordering matches <li> list items. Should include at least one control. Let's use two controls. Or maybe they require the restart instruction as part of controls. In reference example they had \"Arrow keys or A/D to move the paddle\", \"Hold Space to launch faster\", \"Press R or click Restart\". So we should include similar. Our game: \"Tap or click to warp forward\", \"Press R or click Restart\". Might also include \"Avoid obstacles\". But at least those two.\n\nTags: optional array of lowercase keywords. Could use [\"arcade\",\"leap\",\"tap\"].\n\nNote: The page must load without console errors; script empty but must exist. Must include style block. Use minimal CSS to match design guidelines: dark background, simple styling. Ensure <title> matches meta.json.title.\n\nThe script should have no code that errors; empty script is fine. But there should be a placeholder comment maybe // placeholder. Ensure script is not empty but can be empty. Could be comment.\n\nAlso ensure the page includes header with class \"game-header\" etc as defined in conventions. Must follow the required structure exactly:\n\n- <header class=\"game-header\"><h1>YOUR TITLE</h1><p class=\"game-description\">YOUR DESCRIPTION</p><ul class=\"game-controls\"><li>YOUR CONTROL</li>...</ul></header>\n\n- <main> <canvas id=\"game\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\"></canvas> <button id=\"restart\" class=\"game-restart\" type=\"button\">Restart</button> </main>\n\nThe script should be after </main> before </body>.\n\nThe CSS should be minimal but include background. We can set body margin 0, background: #0a0a0f; color: #e6e6f0; font-family.\n\nWe'll need to read DESIGN.md and TASKS.md to see expected content for meta. Let's read them.\n\n{\"filePath\":\"/tmp/slop-factory-work/quantum-leap-1a2c03cc/DESIGN.md\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":2000}","time":{"start":1778500720760,"end":1778500746328}}}
